            "stop",
            "refused",
            "failed",
            "closed"
          ],
          "description": "questions: ask them, then call answerQuestions. step: show current_step and wait for OK, NOT OK or CAN'T DO. finished: all steps done; ask if the machine runs, then closeSession. stop: tell the technician to stop and call callSupervisor. refused: show message only. failed: show message and offer callSupervisor. closed: session is over."
        },
        "machine_no": {
          "type": "string"
